.TH cadcraft-cli-perf 1  "perf " 
.SH NAME
cadcraft\-cli\-perf \- Time the engine on a synthetic N\-entity drawing (default 200000), or the canvas display\-list build of a drawing, zoomed in step by step
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcadcraft\-cli perf\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIN|FILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Time the engine on a synthetic N\-entity drawing (default 200000), or the canvas display\-list build of a drawing, zoomed in step by step
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIN|FILE\fR]
An entity count (clamped to 1\-20000000), or a drawing to time
